# ——— institutional logo files (original art assets, tracked & committed in 4fc6ca6) ———
# These logo files are FROM THE CLIENT's ORIGINAL supplied art and are tracked in
# git. They must NOT be git-ignored. If a logo is ever replaced, the file itself
# is updated and committed — never ignored.
/logo blue background.jpg
/logo transparent background.png
/logo version 2 tranparent bg.png
/logo white background.jpg

# ——— local verification scratch (screenshot/dom captures + headless-browser runtime) ———
# These are artifacts produced during local rendering/audit passes and must never
# be committed to the institutional repository.
/.dev-*.log
/.devpid
/_.verify-home.png
/_home.html
/_home.png
/_chrome-prof/
